  "about": "D1c2 (session 17). Research notes often name a gem or material without saying which quality rank dropped (\"family:<name>\" in the research team's v3 records). This table lists every item ID that carries that name, read from public item pages (warcraft.wiki.gg External-links table = Wowhead/WoWDB ID; one saddlebagexchange.com page set where the wiki page did not load). One ID means the name is not ranked and simply names that item. Several IDs mean the rank is unknown: the addon prices the material at the cheapest of them that has a price. Only the SET of IDs matters, not which one is rank 1 (the sources disagree on the rank order for Crystalline Glass; that does not change the result). tools/research_v3_to_baselines.py reads this file; tests/test_rank_families.py checks its shape. Never take IDs from the research evidence's own name fields: the DF Ysemerald and Neltharite names are swapped there (checked against item pages in session 17; report to the research team).",
